en:
"...???{w}The ones it sings about as friends... that means the Four Sages of the Land, right?"{w}{p}"Let's see, Raizam the Earth Sage, Omshokopo the Wind Sage, Radrecht the Fire Sage, and Shirinmorin the Water Sage... was it?"{w}{p}"Weren't the Four Sages born together with the Earth Goddess -- I mean, Lady Fiona?"{w}{p}"...If so, then who's Urna?{w}None of the folk songs or old tales I know has anyone named Urna in it..."{w}{p}"......"{w}{p}"Something about... this song is bad news.{w}It's just my gut talking, but...
I've got a feeling spreading these lyrics around would be bad news."{w}{p}"...Huh?
The old goblin told you not to sing it, too?{w}I knew it..."{w}{p}"All right, then I'll give up on this song.{w}I'll keep it sealed away inside me."{w}

"Whaaat are you, you mere huuuman!!
Do not paraaade your vulgar face
before meee~! Begone!!"{w}

"Hm, a face I have not seen before. An adventurer?{w}Oh? Then allow me to introduce myself.
I am Volms. A collector of antiquities."{w}{p}"Should you come by any rare articles, bring them to me.
Depending on the piece, I may buy it at a good price."{w}

"Listen to this, customer.{w}Lunea's working really hard, you know.
But no proper customers ever come!"{w}{p}"Just the other day,
this weird kid came over from Semnadoc~"{w}

"Non, non~
I mean a shop on the cutting edge of fashion.
Like, this year's trends."{w}

"That kid's name was Caron,{w}and after that, I got nagged about all sorts of things,
like the shop's decor and how I lay out the goods..."{w}{p}"If I stock even more amazing tentacles and fangs,
maybe I won't get any more complaints?{w}For now, I've got to get some goods to sell..."{w}
